    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>当你在紧急情况下遇见以上情况，请记住使用紧急呼叫，同时保证您的设备开机并且处于信号强度足够的区域。</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Lenovo" changedate="20250902T025428Z" creationid="Lenovo" creationdate="20250902T025428Z">
        <seg>If you encounter these circumstances during an emergency, remember to use emergency calling. Ensure your device is powered on and in an area with sufficient signal strength.</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>当你开车时，请勿使用手持移动终端设备，除非其有免提功能。</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Lenovo" changedate="20250902T013243Z" creationid="Lenovo" creationdate="20250902T013243Z">
        <seg>Do not use hand-held devices while driving. Use hands-free operation only.</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>当你靠近加油站，油库，化工厂或爆炸作业场所，请关闭移动终端设备。</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Lenovo" changedate="20250902T025842Z" creationid="Lenovo" creationdate="20250902T025842Z">
        <seg>Turn off the mobile terminal devices when near gas stations, fuel depots, chemical plants, or blasting sites.</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>当需要采用带状线时，采用带状线阻抗模型进行阻抗计算（如下图）。</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Zhou Ziwei" changedate="20251017T022839Z" creationid="Zhou Ziwei" creationdate="20251017T022839Z">
        <seg>当需要采用带状线时，采用带状线阻抗模型进行阻抗计算（如下图）。</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>当靠近电视，收音机电脑或者其他电子设备时都会产生射频干扰。</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Lenovo" changedate="20250902T025640Z" creationid="Lenovo" creationdate="20250902T025640Z">
        <seg>RF interference may occur when placed near televisions, radios, computers, or other electronic equipments.</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>忽略该提示项可能会导致飞行安全，甚至触犯法律。</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Lenovo" changedate="20250902T024218Z" creationid="Lenovo" creationdate="20250902T024218Z">
        <seg>Failure to comply may jeopardize flight safety and violate aviation regulations.</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>授时接口</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Lenovo" changedate="20250902T031057Z" creationid="Lenovo" creationdate="20250902T031057Z">
        <seg>Timing interface</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>授时接口&lt;s0&gt;*&lt;/s0&gt;</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Lenovo" changedate="20250902T031522Z" creationid="Lenovo" creationdate="20250902T031522Z">
        <seg>Timing interface&lt;s0&gt;*&lt;/s0&gt;</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>接口定义如下表所示。</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Zhou Ziwei" changedate="20251017T024500Z" creationid="Zhou Ziwei" creationdate="20251017T024500Z">
        <seg>The interface is defined as shown in the following table.</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>本节主要介绍使用引脚定义类型、状态以及参数。</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Lenovo" changedate="20250902T062553Z" creationid="Lenovo" creationdate="20250902T062553Z">
        <seg>This chapter mainly introduces the definition, types, states, and parameters of the pins.</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>本节简要介绍模组电源引脚。</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Zhou Ziwei" changedate="20251017T021509Z" creationid="Zhou Ziwei" creationdate="20251017T021509Z">
        <seg>This chapter provides a brief introduction to the module's power pins.</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>模组功能模块列表</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Lenovo" changedate="20250902T030223Z" creationid="Lenovo" creationdate="20250902T030223Z">
        <seg>List of module functions</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>模组应用接口列表</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Zhou Ziwei" changedate="20251016T062041Z" creationid="Lenovo" creationdate="20250902T030927Z">
        <seg>List of Application Interface</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>模组支持USB2.0高速接口，兼容USB2.0/USB1.1协议，接口速率最大支持480Mbps，只支持从模式，USB输入/输出信号兼容USB2.0接口规范。</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Zhou Ziwei" changedate="20251017T024330Z" creationid="Zhou Ziwei" creationdate="20251017T024330Z">
        <seg>The module supports the USB 2.0 High-Speed interface and is compatible with both USB 2.0 and USB 1.1 protocols. It offers a maximum interface rate of up to 480 Mbps and operates only in slave mode. The USB input/output signals are compliant with the USB 2.0 interface specifications.</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>电源管理</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Lenovo" changedate="20250902T030255Z" creationid="Lenovo" creationdate="20250902T030255Z">
        <seg>Power management</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <note>原文：移动终端的无线功能在飞机上禁止开启用以防止对飞机通讯系统的干扰。
改写：飞机上禁止开启移动终端的无线功能以避免对飞机通讯系统的干扰。</note>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>移动终端的无线功能在飞机上禁止开启用以防止对飞机通讯系统的干扰。</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Lenovo" changedate="20250902T024425Z" creationid="Lenovo" creationdate="20250902T023742Z">
        <seg>Disable the wireless function on the mobile terminal device to avoid interference with aircraft communications.</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>该接口可用于AT命令传送、数据传输、软件调试和固件升级。</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Zhou Ziwei" changedate="20251017T024428Z" creationid="Zhou Ziwei" creationdate="20251017T024428Z">
        <seg>The interface can be used for AT command transmission, data transfer, software debugging, and firmware upgrade.</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
    <tu>
      <tuv lang="zh-CN">
        <seg>请停车，再打电话！</seg>
      </tuv>
      <tuv lang="en-GB" changeid="Lenovo" changedate="20250902T013351Z" creationid="Lenovo" creationdate="20250902T013351Z">
        <seg>Drivers must fully park the vehicle before using mobile devices!</seg>
      </tuv>
    </tu>
